ALLOW|||||0:EQ:0|personality
ALLOW|||||0:EQ:8|personality
ALLOW|||||0:EQ:131072|personality
ALLOW|||||0:EQ:131080|personality
ALLOW|||||0:EQ:4294967295|personality
ALLOW||ppc64le||||sync_file_range2,swapcontext
ALLOW||arm,arm64||||arm_fadvise64_64,arm_sync_file_range,breakpoint,cacheflush,set_tls,sync_file_range2
